    "summary": "Tavily offers a certification program for learning and earning API credits. It features a single secure API for real-time search, web extraction, and crawling, popular among over 1 million developers. Key capabilities include retrieving live web data, handling thousands of queries with low latency, and ensuring security through validation layers. Tavily maintains high uptime (99.99%) and efficient response times (180 ms on average). Recent partnerships with major firms like IBM and Databricks highlight its growing influence in the AI development space."
